# GUI04 run B -- the desktop half: wheel_change -> WM_ARROWED -> the desktop
# scrolls the window under the pointer.
#
# Coordinates from measurement-2026-09-25-desk42/method/d42a.actions, whose
# probe run measured the C: drive icon's click point at (38,35) on the 640x480
# screen. The double-click opens C:\, which has ~30 entries and is therefore
# scrollable at this resolution.
100  parkbr
400  move 600 240
900  mark A_DESKTOP
1200 move 38 35
1600 down
1603 up
1615 down
1618 up
2400 move 320 300
3200 mark B_WINOPEN
3600 wheel -1
3700 wheel -1
3800 wheel -1
3900 wheel -1
4000 wheel -1
4100 wheel -1
5000 mark C_SCROLLED
